    "meaning_from_live_values": "On each active receipt, Quantity_Remaining equals the PO line ordered quantity minus the cumulative Quantity_Received of poLineReceiptsForCounting rows through that receipt (CreatedOn order). It is the PO line's open balance just after that receipt was saved, kept as a snapshot. The current open balance lives on the PO line and the PO delivery: Remaining_Quantity = ordered - total received, which is 0 on every line here. It is not ordered minus invoiced. Quantity already invoiced is 0 on every one of these receipts (Invoiced is null and AP_Invoice_Number is null)."
  },
